        "id": 98828,
        "name": "defeateddust",
        "username": "defeateddust",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/defeateddust/{size}/2245_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-08T00:58:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My first game was with EvanDan55 and it was just before rook city came out. I used Legacy because he was the guy in front so why not go with what i though was the main character. I imediatly fell in love with the game though i couldnt afford my own copy till much later. Now I have my own copy of the game a large group of friends who love to play it, and legacy is still my favorite.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\"></p>",
