        "id": 98830,
        "name": "Donner",
        "username": "Donner",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-08T21:02:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My first character was Tachyon. &nbsp;We had Ra, Absolute Zero, Legacy, and Visionary. &nbsp;I thought Tachyon was awesome, moving so fast. &nbsp;And when I later switched to Haka, I felt so slow.... &nbsp;That game was pretty epic. &nbsp;Baron Blade at Megalopolis. &nbsp;Visionary was getting beat down (was at 16 health) and Baron Blade had 16 cards in his discard on his Impulsion side. &nbsp;Then Visionary sacrificed herself to save the world (Brain Burn!). &nbsp;We then beat the Baron handily before he could recoup. &nbsp;We still talk about that save by Visionary.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
