        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-15T11:47:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unity is my weakness character, right now. I would play her way out of proportion. The quotes + the huge damage you can do if you have your army of bots together + Mr. Chomps just works for me.</p>",
